e's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"o_l-hmF2rME","position":61,"timestamp":"01:39:34","rawTrack":"Destiny's Child - Cater 2 U (See Dee remix)","track":{"id":"E2mtgudkDcE","path":"/artists/destiny-s-child/tracks/cater-2-u-see-dee-remix/","slug":"cater-2-u-see-dee-remix","title":"Cater 2 U (See Dee remix)","artist":{"slug":"destinys-child","title":"Destiny's Child"},"artwork":"images/artists/destiny-s-child/tracks/cater-2-u-see-dee-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"o27ZYCf_aK0","slug":"all-day-2021","tags":[6,3,19],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/soulection-all-day-joe-kay/ra.1546296427","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/sets/soulection-all-day"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2021","artwork":"images/episodes/487-5-joe-kay.jpg","content":"**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2021 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay](/episodes/all-day-2021/#joe-kays-set), [Austin Marc](/episodes/all-day-2021/#austin-marcs-set), [Minzi Roberta](/episodes/all-day-2021/#minzi-robertas-set), and [See Dee](/episodes/all-day-2021/#see-dees-set).\n\n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2021/#joe-kays-set) - Los Angeles 🇺🇸\n- [Austin Marc](/episodes/all-day-2021/#austin-marcs-set) - New York 🇺🇸\n- [Minzi Roberta](/episodes/all-day-2021/#minzi-robertas-set) - Toronto 🇨🇦\n- [See Dee](/episodes/all-day-2021/#see-dees-set) - Paris 🇫🇷\n\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2020](/episodes/all-day-2020/), or [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":28800,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-01-01T01:00:00+00:00"},"tit